凍結或解凍任何代幣帳戶之前，我們需要已經完成以下準備：\r\n- 初始化了一個`Mint`帳戶，並且我們持有`freezeAuthority`\r\n- 初始化了一個`Token`帳戶或`Associated Token`帳戶，這是我們想要凍結或解凍的\r\n\r\n以下是對`freeze_account()`指令的CPI操作：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nfreeze_account(\r\n    CpiContext::new(\r\n        ctx.accounts.token_program.to_account_info(),\r\n        FreezeAccount {\r\n            account: ctx.accounts.token_account.to_account_info(),\r\n            mint: ctx.accounts.mint.to_account_info(),\r\n            authority: ctx.accounts.authority.to_account_info(),\r\n        },\r\n    ),\r\n)?;\r\n```\r\n\r\n以下是對`thaw_account()`指令的CPI操作：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nthaw_account(\r\n    CpiContext::new(\r\n        ctx.accounts.token_program.to_account_info(),\r\n        ThawAccount {\r\n            account: ctx.accounts.token_account.to_account_info(),\r\n            mint: ctx.accounts.mint.to_account_info(),\r\n            authority: ctx.accounts.authority.to_account_info(),\r\n        },\r\n    ),\r\n)?;\r\n```","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"rust","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#62E884"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"freeze_account"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"("}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"    CpiContext"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"::"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#62E884"},"childr